          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra thinks of a brilliant (and somewhat torturous) new game to play with Adora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With bonus art by @JustPigeonBlue and @LimeShaped!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
